---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Charitable Status — GWE NGO INDIA"
  description="Legal credentials of Glorious Women Empowerment: Societies Registration Act, 12A & 80G, FCRA registration and PAN details."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Charitable Status</h1>
        <p>Registered, compliant and transparent — our legal credentials.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container prose">
        <img class="page-image" src="/images/charitable-status.webp" alt="Charitable status registration documents of Glorious Women Empowerment" loading="lazy" />
        <p>
          Glorious Women Empowerment is a NGO in India, non-profit, non-political service oriented
          statutory registered society under societies registration Act XXI of 1860 and under
          section 6(1) (a) of the Foreign Contribution (Regulation) Act 1976. It also registered
          under 12A &amp; 80G of Income Tax Exemption Act, 1961. As per the latest amendment in IT
          Act, 12A &amp; 80G has been renewed with concerned Authorities. All the Donations are
          Eligible under tax exemption. FCRA valid registration renewed and it is valid from
          01.01.2022 to 31.12.2026.
        </p>
        <div class="credential-box">
          <ul>
            <li>
              The society also registered under the Income Tax Exemption Act, 1961 vide
              12A FileNo.DIT(E)/HYD/12A/60(12)/10-11, Dated.29.06.2011.
            </li>
            <li>
              All the donations made to Glorious Women Empowerment is tax deductible as per the
              F.No.DIT(E)/HYD/80G/9(07)/11-12, Dated.21.12.2011.
            </li>
            <li>Permanent Account Number (PAN): AABTG0113D</li>
            <li>
              GWE NGO registered with Ministry of Home Affairs under Foreign Contribution Regulation
              Act (FCRA), 1976, FCRA registration number: 010270207, dated.22.02.2008.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Filing Annual Returns to the Income Tax Department, Hyderabad within the time.</li>
          <li>Filing of Renewal of the Society with the District Registrar, Kurnool and to get the Renewal Certificate.</li>
          <li>
            The annual activity and audited financial statement of accounts of all projects
            implementing by the GWE NGO circulates in the general body meeting, beneficiaries, stake
            holders of community to maintain accountability and transparency.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .credential-box {
    background: #f1f3f5;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: var(--space-4);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
  }

  .credential-box ul {
    padding-left: 1.4rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .credential-box li {
    color: #1a3c6e;
    font-size: calc(1rem + 2px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>
